0:04:00.00 --> 0:07:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Neville chases a herd of deer in his car. He then takes out his rifle and prepares to shoot one of them. A lion attacks and kills the deer. Neville leaves as darkness falls.)

0:13:58.40 --> 0:13:59.22
profane word 2 (oh my god)

0:17:05.00 --> 0:18:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Neville tests out vaccines on rats. We see a few dead rats and some aggressive zombie rat.)

0:28:10.00 --> 0:31:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Neville's dog enters a dark building. Neville follows her in panic. He spots a blood trail - and sees a dead deer. He spots the terrified dog hiding under a shelf. A zombie attacks Neville. Neville fires a gun - then runs and jumps out of the window. The zombies follow - but get burnt due to sunlight.)

0:33:45.00 --> 0:34:15.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Neville traps a zombie - then knocks it out with his gun butt.)

0:35:30.00 --> 0:37:05.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Neville injects a compound in the zombie. The zombie screams, suffers a seizure and then flat lines. Neville injects an anti-dote and the zombie recovers.)

0:47:50.00 --> 0:48:50.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Neville shoots a building. He is caught in his own trap, hangs upside down. He then passes out.)

0:50:10.00 --> 0:53:55.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Neville regains consciousness. He cuts the cord and falls down. His leg gets impaled with his own knife. He pulls it out and screams in pain. His dog spots something - and starts barking. A zombie dog pack charge - but stop due to sunlight. Neville crawls back to the car. The sun goes down and the zombie dogs charge. Neville's dog jumps to his defense and takes on the zombie does. Neville reaches his gun and shoots them down. The dog suffers injuries. We see wounds on her neck.)

0:53:46.67 --> 0:53:47.27
profane word 3 (censored)

0:54:00.00 --> 0:56:55.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: Neville gets the dog to the lab and injects her with the compound. When he spots her turning, he starts strangling her [off-camera]. We hear her whines as she struggles to breathe. She then stops and dies.)

1:00:40.00 --> 1:02:40.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A distraught Neville lays bait for a zombie. He drives his car into a zombie horde - then reverses and rams into a pole. The zombies climb on the car and lift the tires up. They then flip the car over and start pushing it over the edge. A bright light scares them away.)

1:03:55.00 --> 1:04:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a missile hit a bridge. The bridge starts collapsing. An out of control helicopter crashes into another one.)

1:13:48.81 --> 1:13:49.75
profane word 2 (my god)

1:20:40.00 --> 1:21:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A zombie horde approach the house. Neville turns on floodlight and sets off explosives. Many zombies die but the house is damaged.)

1:22:20.00 --> 1:30:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see dripping blood on metal. A zombie enters the house and attacks Neville in an elbow choke. Neville stabs his leg with a screwdriver. He then fires an assault rifle at him. There is an explosion. We see a tree on fire. Neville follows the zombie - and shoots him dead. The survivors lock themselves up in the lab. The zombie horde arrive and start head butting the glass door. There is an explosion.)
